| block-program | Kindergarten (k-sequence-commands), carried by grade 1 (g1-code-sequence) | Not new: unit 3 session 2, with the event block and the repeat block added | Unit 3 sessions 3 to 7 (modify, debug, make, explain, the end-of-unit), the year-end check (a new buggy program) |
| system-diagram | New in grade 2 (g2-io-parts, model_out) | Unit 1 session 1: input part, computer box, output part, with arrows | Unit 1 session 2 (one action traced on the device), the mid-year check (a new part placed); grade 3 (g3-software) |
| benefit-risk-chart | New in grade 2 (g2-benefits-harms, model_out) | Unit 1 session 3: two columns, how a tool helps and how it can hurt | Unit 1 session 4 (g2-online-consequences, model_in: what happens next, placed on the chart), unit 1's end-of-unit; grade 3 (g3-benefits-risks) |
