| g2-code-loops | m2-arrays-equal-addends (2.OA.C.4) | Unit 3, sessions 2 to 5 (weeks 14 to 17) | math grade 2 unit 8 (days 132 to 143) | Math teaches it later. As above: the step-through run counts each pass of the repeat aloud, and a square's four sides are counted, not multiplied |
